    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngirerea lu atiakakinio Ngilawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaroatin a Moab, ekwakaye Yorudan alo Yeriko, tolimok Ekapolon Akuj Musa tama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tolimok Ngisirael atamar anakwapea ana elemarete kesi, ejoikinit etiakakinete Ngilawi ngirerea lu elomete ka ni edakasi ngibaren, ni iriamit ngirerea ngulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliworosi ngirerea ngulu ngika Ngilawi, toloma kesi neni. Eliwor ni edakasi ngibaren ika ngaatuk kech, ka ngibaren kech daang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esakitae ni edakasi ngibaren itemio napei alore elosi nikalapatan ngamitae 450 alowaitin kadaang, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sodi min ni eriyan ngiwaitin daang, erai ewae epei ngamitae 900, toyei ere kiding. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esakitae esi iinakinete Ngilawi ngirerea ngikan-kapei lu eyuunotor ngitunga, lu epedori itwaan adukia erai kear niche peiyechakinit. Ani erumor, nakis kesi nabo ngirerea ngiche ngitomwon-omwon ka ngiarei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aapei ka ni edakasi ngibaren, toliworos daang ngirerea ngitomwon-omwon ka ngikan-kauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.21.1+JOS.21.2+JOS.21.3+JOS.21.4+JOS.21.5+JOS.21.6+JOS.21.7+JOS.21.8+JOS.21.9+JOS.21.10+JOS.21.11+JOS.21.12+JOS.21.13+JOS.21.14+JOS.21.15+JOS.21.16+JOS.21.17+JOS.21.18+JOS.21.19+JOS.21.20+JOS.21.21+JOS.21.22+JOS.21.23+JOS.21.24+JOS.21.25+JOS.21.26+JOS.21.27+JOS.21.28+JOS.21.29+JOS.21.30+JOS.21.31+JOS.21.32+JOS.21.33+JOS.21.34+JOS.21.35+JOS.21.36+JOS.21.37+JOS.21.38+JOS.21.39+JOS.21.40+JOS.21.41+JOS.21.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoch 21:1-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ejoikinit ekimar a ngirerea a Ngilawi, lu elemuni ekitela daang, itemio ka etiae a akwap kangina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngirerea lu edokinio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Ekapolon Akuj Musa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atamar tolimok Ngisirael tama, “Na idokareta esi ekwakaye angolol a Yorudan tolomasi nakwap a Kanaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esakitae esi iseunete ngirerea lu eloose ngitunga na edokinioto, lu epedori itwaan amatar erai kear niche peiyechakinit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni ngesi edukea ngesi anitwaan ani esaki atachakin akitu a eyenet keng alo atoana. Itwaan ni ititakinio atamar earit niche, nyejoikinit eario mati keyaun lokies alongaren ngitunga daang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toseutu ngirerea ngikan-kapei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguuni alo kide Yorudan ka nguuni anakwap a Kanaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliworosi ngulu ngirerea lu edokinete Ngisirael ka ngitunga a ngakwapea anache lu eraakasi ngikalotok ka lu elomito neni. Itwaan daang ni eari itwaan peiyechakinit epedori alosit ni eyei epei a ngirerea kangulu toduk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nakaneni ani keram itwaan niche a ibore anisuat, totoan, aliwor ngesi ekaaran, eario ngesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kimas ngesi itwaan a amoru taar, aliwor ngesi ekaaran, eario ngesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kori ani keram ngesi itwaan a akitoe, taar, aliwor ngesi ekaaran, eario ngesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epedori eyenet a itwaan anikatoan taar ekaaran ngolo. Ani keanyu eyenet ngolo ngesi, ejoikinit eari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani keremokin itwaan niche sodi taar ani emasakinea ngesi nalup, kori emasea a ibore ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kori ani elulungikinea akan, aliwor ngesi ekaaran, eario ngesi. Epedori eyenet a itwaan anikatoan kangini taar ekaaran ngolo. Ani keanyu eyenet ngolo ngesi, ejoikinit eari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani bo kear itwaan niche peiyechakinit ani ejukarea kimasak nalup kori ani emasea a ibore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kori ani bo kimasa itwaan amoru peitee, tolot amoru ngina taar itwaan nipeasaki ngesi akiwan kori pearai emoit keng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kikokis ngakiro neni ejoikinit ngitunga etiakete ngakiro nguna, sodi toikis itwaan nikaaran, meere eyenet a itwaan anikatoan, lo esaki atachakin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejoikinit ngitunga eyuunete itwaan nikaaran aloyenet a itwaan anikatoan, sodi tobuasi lore lo adokinit lokolong sek alosit ngesi adukia. Ejoikinit ngesi iboikin neni tanang ni etoanea itwaan ni erai emuron loapolon a Akuj a ngirwa kangulu, ani erumor tobongo nawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kerotoki itwaan ni aari niche peiyechakinit alore alosek alosit adukia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sodi taanyu ngesi eyenet a itwaan ani kolong aari ngesi, taar ekatachakinan akitu keng ngesi, nyerai itwaan ni atachakini akitu ngini ekaaran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejoikinit itwaan ni aari niche peiyechakinit elomi lore lo edukitor tanang emuron loapolon etoani, ani ekisidi a akitu a emuron kangolo, tobongo ngesi nawi keng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
